@startuml
title cmp - Static learning website and independent exercises
artifact "French Markdown lessons\nstable module IDs" as Lessons
artifact "Approved PlantUML sources\nand generated SVG diagrams" as UML
component "Documentation site build\npinned stable version" as Build
artifact "Static HTML, CSS, JavaScript\nlocal search index" as Output
node "Static host\nGitHub Pages proposed" as Host
component "Learner browser" as Browser
cloud "Dedicated GitHub practice repositories" {
  artifact "C/C++ examples and exercises\naccepted commit revision" as Code
}
Build ..> Lessons : reads
Build ..> UML : embeds generated previews
Build --> Output : generates
Host ..> Output : serves
Browser --> Host : requests course pages
Browser --> Code : follows available source links
component "Local IDE and toolchain" as IDE
IDE --> Code : clones selected repository
note bottom of Code
  Exercises execute independently of the site framework.
  Enable links only for existing published targets.
end note
@enduml
